<title>JAPAN: General Sekiyu becomes Esso subsidiary.</title>
<headline>General Sekiyu becomes Esso subsidiary.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Sekiyu KK said on Wednesday that it had become a subsidiary of Esso Eastern Inc after shares held directly by Esso and those held by an Esso affiliate together topped 50 percent.</p>
</text>
